<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Accesso Negato • RoomUp!</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/img/butterfly_avatar.jpg">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-base: #0f1117;
      --bg-card: #1a1d26;
      --bg-card-hover: #212530;
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --border-hover: rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.45);
      --primary: #5865F2;
      --primary-hover: #4752C4;
      --accent-red: #f23f43;
      --text-main: #f2f3f5;
      --text-muted: #949ba4;
      --squircle-radius: 22%;
      --card-radius: 14px;
      --control-radius: 10px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }
    body {
      background: var(--bg-base);
      color: var(--text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .error-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--card-radius);
      max-width: 460px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      animation: enter 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    }
    @keyframes enter {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
    .icon-box {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      border-radius: var(--squircle-radius);
      background: rgba(242, 63, 67, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(242, 63, 67, 0.25);
      color: var(--accent-red);
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
      color: var(--text-main);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }
    p {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }
    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }
    .btn {
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: var(--control-radius);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.3);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--primary-hover);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(88, 101, 242, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #18191f;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      color: var(--text-main);
      background: #202129;
      border-color: var(--border-hover);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-card">
    <div class="icon-box">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
    </div>
    <h1>Accesso Negato</h1>
    <p>Ti serve il permesso di <strong>Amministratore</strong> o <strong>Gestisci Server</strong> per aprire questo pannello.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> I Miei Server</a>
      <a href="/logout" class="btn btn-secondary"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-from-bracket"></i> Cambia Account</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
